<listitem><para>DENIAL: Operation cannot proceed (invalid input, constraint violation)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>FALLBACK: Acceleration unavailable, fallback to CPU required</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>REASONING_CONFLICT: Knowledge graph inference conflict detected </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
